  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Roflumilast is used to treat chronic obstructive pulmonary disease and, as a topical preparation, psoriasis. It is authorised in the European Union for COPD and is an approved medicine, though some EU products have been withdrawn.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q693482&quot;>Wikidata Q693482</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>roflumilast</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>D05AX06, R03DX07</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB01656&quot;>DB01656</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/449193&quot;>449193</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:47657&quot;>47657</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q693482&quot;>Q693482</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C17H14Cl2F2N2O3</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>403.206 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
